{"id":"n87901-1-7","stage":1,"title":"편찮다 · 不适","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87901-1-7-1","ko":"선생님, 어디 편찮으세요?","zh":"老师，您哪里不舒服吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선생님,","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师。","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"편찮으세요?","meaning":"不适，不舒服","explanation":"편찮다：不适，不舒服；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"편찮다","audio":"/audio/6ec04ef1c8d756903863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87901","senseId":"1","lemma":"편찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편찮으세요","audio":"/audio/22db26a239d801daaf9e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"老师，教师","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"(敬语)教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"6ec04ef1c8d75690","term":"편찮다","zh":"不适，不舒服","audio":"/audio/6ec04ef1c8d756903863.mp3","entryId":"87901","definition":"身体或内心不痛快或难受。","pronunciation":["편찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/7d4d2352af3e6a71db59.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87901-1-7-2","ko":"독한 감기에 걸려서 정신이 좀 없네.","zh":"我得了重感冒，有点头昏脑胀的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"독한","meaning":"冲，浓烈","explanation":"독하다：冲，浓烈；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"독하다","audio":"/audio/2eac8bcfcababe3cf3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14788","senseId":"2","lemma":"독하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"독한","audio":"/audio/60217cc1ac78810fa010.mp3"}},{"text":"감기에","meaning":"感冒","explanation":"감기：感冒；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"감기","audio":"/audio/2c4cdf56b777f3677c17.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28635","senseId":"1","lemma":"감기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"감기에","audio":"/audio/b758d0ed4f382a0f8653.mp3"}},{"text":"걸려서","meaning":"患","explanation":"걸리다：患；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"8","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸려서","audio":"/audio/78c87e4c8b27674bc627.mp3"}},{"text":"정신이","meaning":"精神，意识","explanation":"정신：精神，意识；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정신","audio":"/audio/2c3d6b050d278eb5e5ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75789","senseId":"3","lemma":"정신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정신이","audio":"/audio/825e7f351339df4a5703.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네","audio":"/audio/40299a69ec2e93a5e2b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2eac8bcfcababe3c","term":"독하다","zh":"冲，浓烈","audio":"/audio/2eac8bcfcababe3cf3fb.mp3","entryId":"14788","definition":"味道或气味等过分地刺激。","pronunciation":["도카다"]},{"id":"2c4cdf56b777f367","term":"감기","zh":"感冒","audio":"/audi